{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/3acdaf6202bef9d2ed63a672eb2e2365.avif?t=1765906785\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake in an abandoned psychiatric ward.</strong> The halls loop endlessly, the lights fail without warning, and something in the dark remembers you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted, looping asylum in this first-person psychological horror. Use your flashlight to search for clues, unlock new areas, and survive the entity that stalks you. Every step forward brings you closer to uncovering the truth, and the past you tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person exploration with tense, claustrophobic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping level design that changes as you progress </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight mechanics that reveal and conceal danger </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore-rich environmental storytelling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic horror presentation with unsettling audio design </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You awaken in a rotting asylum.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No direction. No answers. Just walls that hum and shadows that stretch too long. Something is watching. And it remembers you. This place remembers you. But you don\u2019t remember it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not yet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1f4cec7b29176301a40122af376a40df.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1f4cec7b29176301a40122af376a40df.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1f4cec7b29176301a40122af376a40df.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>What You\u2019ll Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f First-person psychological horror: No combat, no handholding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Navigate a looping, handcrafted asylum filled with tension and dread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Flashlight mechanics where light is both lifeline\u2026 and liability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f A fear-based entity that evolves the more you uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Ten patient profiles; each distorting your memory and the world around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Minimal UI, immersive sound, and no checkpoints</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f A standalone game in a four-game psychological horror anthology</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ward doesn\u2019t change. But something in it does.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every file you find distorts the feeling of the space - subtly. Light flickers. Paths feel less certain. Whispers twist. And always, the thing hunting you grows closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a866b45ea75d79e8a964ff78dc5b5d87.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a866b45ea75d79e8a964ff78dc5b5d87.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a866b45ea75d79e8a964ff78dc5b5d87.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some truths were meant to be buried.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sins were never yours to dig up. But you keep going - deeper into the walls\u2026 and into yourself. You won\u2019t find checkpoints. You won\u2019t find forgiveness. You\u2019ll find a door that wasn\u2019t there before. And behind it - something that feels like a memory.  <strong>Or a warning.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 The Forgotten Ward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward</strong> is a psychological horror game about guilt, memory, and the consequences that never stay buried. This isn\u2019t about survival. It\u2019s about what you remember... and what won\u2019t let go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You didn\u2019t just end up in the ward.</strong><br><br><strong>You were always meant to return.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1ef81466e8788573884218e4482ad53c.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1ef81466e8788573884218e4482ad53c.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/1ef81466e8788573884218e4482ad53c.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forgotten Ward doesn\u2019t want you here\u2026</strong><br><br><strong>But it remembers you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A complete, standalone game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Forgotten Ward</i> is the first in a planned anthology of psychological horror \u2014 each game tells a different story in the same haunted universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/7b7816b9227a0f3a9216734eb5362bf2.avif?t=1765906785\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror experience with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven exploration in a looping, handcrafted asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fear-based entity that evolves as you uncover more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight mechanics where visibility and vulnerability are one and the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 patient profiles to discover, each unlocking a deeper layer of memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI, immersive audio, and no handholding, only what you\u2019re willing to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone game in a four-game anthology of psychological horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>For Players Who Liked:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you were drawn to the emotional dread and mystery of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Hill 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amnesia: The Dark Descent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returnal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories Untold</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlast</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martha Is Dead</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...then <strong>Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward\u00a0</strong>was made to follow you home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843760?t=1765906785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/9a83aad18cae2ddeee500d5e1a7fa3ded67e09ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765906785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/f94feb7805ec384b922c37ca45076026fc4a1565/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765906785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/f94feb7805ec384b922c37ca45076026fc4a1565/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765906785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing themes including psychological trauma, mental illness, and depictions of psychiatric abuse. Players will experience intense scenes involving fear, restraint, electroshock therapy, and symbolic punishment. This content may be distressing to some players. Viewer discretion is advised.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/3acdaf6202bef9d2ed63a672eb2e2365.avif?t=1765906785\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake in an abandoned psychiatric ward.</strong> The halls loop endlessly, the lights fail without warning, and something in the dark remembers you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/4d838d1102b87d8f68d120f2564885b2.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted, looping asylum in this first-person psychological horror. Use your flashlight to search for clues, unlock new areas, and survive the entity that stalks you. Every step forward brings you closer to uncovering the truth, and the past 