</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight mechanics where visibility and vulnerability are one and the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 patient profiles to discover, each unlocking a deeper layer of memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI, immersive audio, and no handholding, only what you\u2019re willing to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone game in a four-game anthology of psychological horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.poster.avif?t=1765906785\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.webm?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/adfd2b3b33706de928634abdf7785555.mp4?t=1765906785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>For Players Who Liked:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you were drawn to the emotional dread and mystery of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Hill 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amnesia: The Dark Descent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returnal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories Untold</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlast</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martha Is Dead</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...then <strong>Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward\u00a0</strong>was made to follow you home.</p>","developers":["Crimson Cloud Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adv